  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-keyboard-history",
      "text": "[English](README.en.md) | 中文\n\n[](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com)\n\n[](https://github.com/NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-keyboard-history)\n\n**DSH Web 会话输入框的极简输入历史插件：空输入框时按 ↑/↓ 翻阅之前发过的消息，仅此而已。**"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile <你的profile名> add dsh-keyboard-history\n```\n\n装好后重启 `dsh web` 即可生效。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "- **↑**：空输入框时召回上一条已发送的消息，继续按回翻更早\n- **↓**：向新翻，越过最新一条回到空框\n- 编辑、发送后自动退出翻阅；斜杠菜单、中文输入法、会话忙碌等场景下不打扰你"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-keyboard-history",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.md)\n\n[](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com)\n\n[](https://github.com/NormanFxxkingRockwell/dsh-keyboard-history)\n\n**A minimal input-history plugin for the DSH web composer: with an empty input box, press ↑/↓ to walk through messages you have sent. Nothing else.**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile <your-profile-name> add dsh-keyboard-history\n```\n\nThen restart `dsh web`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "- **↑**: on an empty input, recall the newest sent message; keep pressing to walk older\n- **↓**: walk newer; one press past the newest clears back to an empty box\n- editing or sending exits the browse state automatically; never interferes with the slash menu, IME input, or a busy session"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
